{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2017b-k2.q32.material.recovered", "text": "材料： 下面是某位政治教师在讲授“社会发展的规律”一课时的导入环节。 师：老师与同学的见面是从相互问好开始的。通过相互问好，我们就认识了。除了相互问好这一见面礼仪，同学们还知道哪些中外见面礼仪呢？ 生答：握手、拥抱、揖手礼、合十礼等。 （展示图片：握手、拥抱等） 师：见面礼仪是一个国家民族文化的重要表现，它随着历史的发展也在不断地变迁，比如我们中国传统的见面礼仪是揖手礼，现在我们见面一般都是握手。礼仪的变化事实上见证了整个社会的发展，那么，社会历史的发展有什么特点呢？又有什么规律呢？这就是我们今天要共同学习的内容：第十一课，“寻觅社会的真谛”——社会发展的规律。 （板书课题）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bb36c01b56664af813e2d7efef1957f3a1fc63c43365f61af53e1566ecb7525d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3549, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3841, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bb36c01b56664af813e2d7efef1957f3a1fc63c43365f61af53e1566ecb7525d"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2017b-k2.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k09"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.409.r002", "ntce.outline.409.r003", "ntce.outline.409.r005", "ntce.outline.409.r006"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2017b-k2.q32"], "word_count": 291, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bb36c01b56664af813e2d7efef1957f3a1fc63c43365f61af53e1566ecb7525d", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3549, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3841, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_s